one of Mexico's most distinguished living artists, philosophers, and critic, Dr. Adelman. Doctor,

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:25.220
for the purposes of dramatization and condensation, you allowed us certain liberties with your

00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:29.980
incredible story, but the psychic occurrence that happened...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.420
exactly as reenacted, isn't that so?

00:22:33.090 --> 00:22:33.370
Yes.

00:22:33.630 --> 00:22:38.130
In 1920, in the courgear of El Convento de la Merced.

00:22:38.780 --> 00:22:43.040
El Convento de la Merced is the convent that we photographed

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:44.710
in the first part of the picture.

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:49.960
I saw an officer strangled to death by someone

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:53.440
or something not visible to the eye.

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:58.010
The officer was strangled by someone.

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:02.440
or something not to be seen by the eye.

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:04.690
It's an incredible story, Doctor.

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:07.420
And you were saved from a murder charge

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:10.710
by the use of a plaster of Paris cast,

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.060
similar to this one,

00:23:13.890 --> 00:23:15.660
taken of the dead man, no?

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:17.190
That's correct.

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:19.850
For the marks on the throat

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:24.290
could only have been made by a geon.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.840
And apparently, I am far from that.

00:23:28.080 --> 00:23:29.960
Doctor, show me exactly how you put your...

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:31.470
hand on the throat to defend yourself.

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:35.610
My words are incredible. How small your hand is

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:37.740
compared to this hand of the giant, huh?

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:43.280
Adol, how close were you, whatever?

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:47.920
Close I am to you, and I

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:49.860
see you quite clearly.

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:53.830
Thank you, Doctor. Explain it.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:59.820
All we can say is that...

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:00.880
It happened.

00:24:01.884 --> 00:24:02.844
Until that now.

00:24:04.476 --> 00:24:06.476
Why was El Convento de la Mercete?

00:24:07.324 --> 00:24:08.524
haunted by that spectre.

00:24:09.884 --> 00:24:11.064
Could it be?

00:24:11.196 --> 00:24:12.916
that among all those millions,

00:24:13.436 --> 00:24:14.436
sacrificed

00:24:14.492 --> 00:24:15.052
savagely.

00:24:15.772 --> 00:24:16.932
throughout bloody history.

00:24:18.332 --> 00:24:19.432
Something remains.

00:24:20.188 --> 00:24:21.188
here on Earth.

00:24:22.044 --> 00:24:22.304
made.

00:24:22.492 --> 00:24:23.712
Troubled shadow too.

00:24:24.380 --> 00:24:25.380
remind the living

00:24:26.588 --> 00:24:27.888
that injustice has been done.

00:24:30.028 --> 00:24:30.468
I wonder.
